{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_01_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_01","title":"外勤記錄","storyCode":"OD-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"31d03b1797ada937d6a7c4f3c3607b4df77c06426b5b4060e281b911bc00fef1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"巡林者與其他幾位羅德島幹員的外勤任務出現了意外。由於失去了回程的交通工具，四位幹員不得不徒步穿過薩爾貢荒漠。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"前方三十公里範圍內沒有值得注意的目標，這片區域目前暫定是安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，讓老夫看看地圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"方向不會有錯，繼續向北走，就能看到一個被本地人叫做喇叭山的地標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以在山腳下休息，然後再向西走兩天的路程，就能到達費坤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"費坤城是我們的目的地嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不是，但它是最合適的中轉站。費坤有哥倫比亞人的大篷車商隊，我們可以跟著商隊一起去雙河城，那邊有羅德島的辦事處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"只要到了辦事處，就能想辦法弄到交通工具，剩下的事情就很好辦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！終於可以結束這次徒步遠征了，我的鞋底都要磨平了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多在外面走一走對你的身體有好處，你也不用老惦記著減肥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊器怎麼樣了，能聯繫到信號節點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是不行，看這個情況，直到費坤之前都很難和羅德島本艦取得直接聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非我們能弄到一個功率更大的發射器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想了，這附近沒有其他移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是，到達費坤之前我們都很難得到補給，所以老夫之前讓你們帶上足夠多的食物和水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我印象中這附近有其他小型聚落，但是這麼多年了，這些城鎮是否還在原來的地方，老夫可說不準。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者先生對這片區域很熟悉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......老夫年輕的時候可能會更熟悉一點。其實這片荒地我已經很久沒來過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那張地圖，是巡林者先生自己畫的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是，每個巡林者都會繪製自己的地圖，只是我沒想到這張地圖現在還能用。這裡的地貌沒被天災改變太多，算是我們運氣好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，這次又麻煩您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"放寬心，照顧你們這些年輕人是老夫的職責所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這次意外我也有責任。如果提前想好預備方案，就不至於如此狼狽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一群來歷不明的雇傭兵襲擊了倉庫，又恰好搶走了我們的車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種故事，誰會信啊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懷疑那個商人是偷偷拆了我們的車拿去賣，然後隨便編了個理由來糊弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我難得同意你的觀點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得兩個字很多餘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以黑鋼傭兵的習慣，放在以前我不會這麼輕易饒了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是以羅德島幹員的身份，老夫還是希望你們儘量不要和本地人發生衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"藥品安全送達，那個商人也沒有在報酬上耍花招，我們也不能要求太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"但是提著一袋精煉源石錠徒步走在荒地上，實在是太危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的解釋充滿漏洞，你也不能指望瓦伊凡的本地雇傭兵說實話，下一次老夫就得多長個心眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不過回去之後得向後勤報告一下財物損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......瓦伊凡就是這樣的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有地圖和法術，老夫也能想辦法找到方向，但是那樣會耗費太多時間。我們人太多，水和食物堅持不了那麼久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"在薩爾貢荒地中不依靠工具就能判斷方向？您要如何做到呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"以後有機會我可以教教你，都是經驗而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該怎麼說呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是那位“紅色山谷的遊俠”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，原來你們年輕人也會講這些老故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是個言過其實的稱號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以那些故事是真的嗎？一天之內把詹金斯七兄弟全數抓捕歸案，單槍匹馬擋下整支鏽錘劫匪縱隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用一支箭擊中十個目標，凌空射下拉特蘭人的連發銃彈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣，這些故事現在都變成這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鋼的薩爾貢同行們偶爾會講述巡林者的故事，大多都是這種風格的段子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是很適合寫小說的題材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑小姐也聽說過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"以前在哥倫比亞，一位走南闖北的傭兵講過幾個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"叫做“血色山谷的彎刀”和“王酋之災”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......這個就有點誇張了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者不是你們想像的那種組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫不知道你們都聽到了什麼樣的傳聞，但傳播最廣的故事多半都不是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者不是專職戰鬥的組織，要我形容的話，更像是一群聯合起來的荒野求生者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"最開始他們只是幾個苦陷於動盪年代的普通人，在戰亂中挺身而出，保護那些被歹人劫掠的村落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不是訓練有素的戰士，而是在無法避免的戰爭與不見寧日的劫掠中誕生的反抗者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他們滿腔怒火，他們拒絕對戰亂歲月的殘酷命運屈膝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，加入他們的人越來越多，組織也慢慢地從自治民兵演變成區域性團體，在荒地上向各大聚落提供醫療和防衛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這部分我在黑鋼的出勤記錄裡見過。在薩爾貢地區，除了官方隊伍之外，巡林者也會追剿荒地中的歹徒與劫掠村落的傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的事情的確有過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，巡林者的隊伍裡確實......有過那麼幾個好漢，也確實抓過幾個歹人。你描述的事情發生過，但不是常態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分時間裡，巡林者們只是幫鎮子上的人修理水井、抵禦野獸、搜集藥品，就只是這些瑣事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上，當年，這片區域還沒被併入薩爾貢的領土......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，巡林者老先生當年肯定是那些“好漢”中的一員了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，老夫可沒有那麼威風，我只是個普通的斥候而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......普通......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"但是巡林者這個組織，最後還是解散了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這就說來話長了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"再後來，發生了很多事情。戰爭結束了，王酋們得到了他們想要的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"對於薩爾貢王酋們來說，巡林者這類拒絕順從的組織是不能被容忍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，除了王酋的態度，巡林者的解散還有許多其他原因，不過那都是往事，具體的來龍去脈已經遺落在老夫的腦袋裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以那些誇張的故事，其實都沒有發生過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"真相往往是平淡無奇的，只有描述誇張的傳說才有戲劇性，又只有戲劇性足夠的故事才能被傳下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你們聽到的故事都經過了重重藝術加工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，故事如果沒有意思，也就沒有人會願意去講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，老頭子的故事就講到這裡，我們準備動身吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你們的態度，我們這是已經進入薩爾貢境內了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們昨天晚上就已經進入薩爾貢了。麻煩你多注意點，回頭闖了禍我可不會救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好煩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在踏足的土地隸屬於薩爾貢的巴耶勒王酋，不過他的行都距離這裡還很遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著！不要動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......你聽到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"都不要移動，有什麼東西在靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇&芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......就在附近......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們腳下！快散開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡！躲開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醜陋的變異生物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咆哮聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這是什麼生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......沙地獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長成這樣的沙地獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻、兩隻......這也太多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"拉開陣型！準備戰鬥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
